---
import BlockLayout from '../layouts/BlockLayout.astro';
const built = new Date().toISOString();
---
<BlockLayout title="Drum Rain — a ten-minute summer storm of drum hits" description="Look down through a green pavilion at a wet stone tile floor. Drums fall like rain. The arc rises from drizzle to downpour to thunder, then tapers back to drizzle. Set it and listen.">
  <main class="dr" id="dr" data-built={built}>
    <header class="dr__hero">
      <p class="dr__kicker">DRUM · RAIN · drizzle to downpour and back · ten minutes</p>
      <h1 class="dr__title">A storm on a tile floor.</h1>
      <p class="dr__sub">Looking down through the pavilion onto wet stone tiles. Drums fall like rain. Light drizzle for two minutes, then steady rain, then a downpour with one slow thunder bell, then tapering, then drizzle again. Each drop is one drum hit. No buttons after you press play.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="dr__stage" id="dr-stage" data-state="idle">
      <div class="dr__pavilion" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="dr__rail dr__rail--top"></div>
        <div class="dr__rail dr__rail--bottom"></div>
        <div class="dr__post dr__post--left"></div>
        <div class="dr__post dr__post--right"></div>
        <canvas class="dr__canvas" id="dr-canvas" width="1400" height="780"></canvas>
      </div>

      <div class="dr__overlay" id="dr-overlay">
        <button class="dr__play" id="dr-play" type="button" aria-label="Begin">
          <span class="dr__play-icon" id="dr-play-icon">▶</span>
          <span class="dr__play-label" id="dr-play-label">Begin</span>
        </button>
        <p class="dr__overlay-hint">ten minutes · headphones recommended · no buttons after this</p>
      </div>

      <div class="dr__status" id="dr-status" hidden>
        <span class="dr__status-time" id="dr-status-time">00:00</span>
        <span class="dr__status-sep">of</span>
        <span class="dr__status-total">10:00</span>
        <span class="dr__status-section" id="dr-status-section">drizzle</span>
        <button class="dr__end" id="dr-end" type="button">end early</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="dr__about">
      <h2 class="dr__about-h">The weather</h2>
      <p>The storm is shaped like a 10-section arc, 60 seconds each: <em>drizzle, gathering, steady rain, building, downpour, thunder, tapering, slowing, light rain, drizzle again</em>. Drop probability per beat slot moves from 0.04 at the start to 0.85 at the peak and back. The thunder section adds a slow bell on the section boundary.</p>
      <p>Each drum hit is a ripple on the tile floor. Hi-hat hits are small ripples. Snare hits are medium. Kick hits are large with a soft outer wave. Bell hits are widest and last the longest. The ripples decay quadratically over a second or so. At the height of the storm there are many ripples on screen at once.</p>
      <p>Voices: high-passed white-noise hat (8 kHz+), band-passed noise snare around 2 kHz with a soft 220 Hz triangle tap, 60→30 Hz sine kick, three-partial bell at 600 / 1200 / 1800 Hz with a four-second decay for the thunder. All synth, no samples.</p>
      <p>Sister surfaces in the meditative register: <a href="/drum-garden">/drum-garden</a> · <a href="/cast-tide">/cast-tide</a> · <a href="/cast-room">/cast-room</a> · <a href="/cast-cradle">/cast-cradle</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <style is:global>
    :root {
      --dr-frame: #1f5e3a;
      --dr-cream: #e3e0d3;
      --dr-text: #2a3326;
      --dr-text-dim: #5a6356;
      --dr-text-dimmer: #8a9285;
    }

    body:has(.dr) {
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%, #f8f6ec 0%, #ece8d8 70%);
      color: var(--dr-text);
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .dr { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 24px 80px; }

    .dr__hero { text-align: left; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 36px; }
    .dr__kicker {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
      font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: var(--dr-frame);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0 0 14px;
    }
    .dr__title {
      font-family: 'Inter Tight', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 64px);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1.05;
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      color: var(--dr-text);
    }
    .dr__sub {
      font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--dr-text-dim);
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* STAGE — green pavilion frame, top-down tile floor inside */
    .dr__stage { position: relative; margin-bottom: 36px; }
    .dr__pavilion {
      position: relative;
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
      max-height: 75vh;
      background: #1a2826;
      border: 14px solid var(--dr-frame);
      border-radius: 4px;
      box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(31,94,58,0.18), inset 0 0 0 3px rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .dr__rail {
      position: absolute;
      left: 0; right: 0;
      height: 16px;
      background: var(--dr-frame);
      z-index: 2;
    }
    .dr__rail--top { top: 0; }
    .dr__rail--bottom { bottom: 0; }
    .dr__post {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; bottom: 0;
      width: 14px;
      background: var(--dr-frame);
      z-index: 2;
    }
    .dr__post--left  { left: 33%; }
    .dr__post--right { right: 33%; }

    .dr__canvas {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      z-index: 1;
      display: block;
    }

    /* OVERLAY */
    .dr__overlay {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 16px;
      z-index: 5;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(244,241,229,0.4) 0%, rgba(244,241,229,0.1) 60%, transparent 100%);
      backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
      transition: opacity 600ms ease, visibility 600ms;
    }
    .dr__stage[data-state="playing"] .dr__overlay,
    .dr__stage[data-state="ended"] .dr__overlay {
      opacity: 0;
      visibility: hidden;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .dr__stage[data-state="ended"] .dr__overlay {
      visibility: visible;
      opacity: 1;
      pointer-events: auto;
      transition-delay: 0.8s;
    }
    .dr__play {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 0;
      border: 0;
      background: transparent;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .dr__play-icon {
      width: 96px;
      height: 96px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--dr-frame);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 32px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      box-shadow:
        0 14px 36px rgba(31,94,58,0.32),
        inset 0 -4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.12),
        inset 0 4px 6px rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
      transition: transform 100ms ease;
    }
    .dr__play:hover .dr__play-icon { transform: scale(1.04); }
    .dr__play:active .dr__play-icon { transform: scale(0.96); }
    .dr__play-label {
      font-family: 'Inter Tight', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 17px;
      color: var(--dr-text);
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }
    .dr__overlay-hint {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--dr-text-dimmer);
      text-transform: lowercase;
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* STATUS */
    .dr__status {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 28px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 8px;
      z-index: 5;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      background: rgba(244,241,229,0.92);
      border: 1px solid rgba(31,94,58,0.18);
      border-radius: 14px;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--dr-text-dim);
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.6s ease 0.6s;
    }
    .dr__stage[data-state="playing"] .dr__status,
    .dr__stage[data-state="ended"] .dr__status { opacity: 1; }
    .dr__stage[data-state="ended"] .dr__status { opacity: 0.7; }
    .dr__status-time {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--dr-text);
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }
    .dr__status-sep { color: var(--dr-text-dimmer); }
    .dr__status-total { color: var(--dr-text); }
    .dr__status-section {
      margin-left: 12px;
      color: var(--dr-frame);
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .dr__end {
      margin-left: 12px;
      padding: 2px 10px;
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid rgba(31,94,58,0.32);
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: var(--dr-frame);
      cursor: pointer;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }
    .dr__end:hover { background: rgba(31,94,58,0.08); }

    /* ABOUT */
    .dr__about {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 12px 0 0;
    }
    .dr__about-h {
      font-family: 'Inter Tight', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 22px;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      color: var(--dr-text);
      margin: 0 0 14px;
    }
    .dr__about p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--dr-text-dim);
      margin: 0 0 14px;
    }
    .dr__about em { color: var(--dr-frame); font-style: italic; }
    .dr__about a {
      color: var(--dr-frame);
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
      text-underline-offset: 3px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .dr__pavilion { border-width: 10px; }
      .dr__post { width: 10px; }
      .dr__rail { height: 12px; }
    }
  </style>

  <script>
    import { createAudioScheduler } from '../lib/audio-scheduler';

    // ---- audio scaffolding ----
    type Voice = 'hat' | 'snare' | 'kick' | 'bell';

    let ctx: AudioContext | null = null;
    let scheduler: ReturnType<typeof createAudioScheduler> | null = null;
    let masterGain: GainNode | null = null;
    let noiseBuf: AudioBuffer | null = null;

    function ensureCtx() {
      if (ctx) return;
      ctx = new (window.AudioContext || (window as any).webkitAudioContext)();
      scheduler = createAudioScheduler(ctx);
      masterGain = ctx.createGain();
      masterGain.gain.value = 0.55;
      masterGain.connect(ctx.destination);
    }
    function noise(ac: AudioContext): AudioBuffer {
      if (noiseBuf) return noiseBuf;
      const len = ac.sampleRate * 2;
      const b = ac.createBuffer(1, len, ac.sampleRate);
      const d = b.getChannelData(0);
      for (let i = 0; i < len; i++) d[i] = Math.random() * 2 - 1;
      noiseBuf = b;
      return b;
    }

    function playHat(t: number, vel = 1) {
      if (!ctx || !scheduler || !masterGain) return;
      const src = ctx.createBufferSource();
      src.buffer = noise(ctx);
      const hp = ctx.createBiquadFilter();
      hp.type = 'highpass';
      hp.frequency.value = 8400;
      const g = ctx.createGain();
      g.gain.setValueAtTime(0.0001, t);
      g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.18 * vel, t + 0.002);
      g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, t + 0.05);
      src.connect(hp).connect(g).connect(masterGain);
      scheduler.trackSource(src);
      src.start(t);
      src.stop(t + 0.07);
    }
    function playSnare(t: number, vel = 1) {
      if (!ctx || !scheduler || !masterGain) return;
      const src = ctx.createBufferSource();
      src.buffer = noise(ctx);
      const bp = ctx.createBiquadFilter();
      bp.type = 'bandpass';
      bp.frequency.value = 2200;
      bp.Q.value = 0.7;
      const g = ctx.createGain();
      g.gain.setValueAtTime(0.0001, t);
      g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.32 * vel, t + 0.004);
      g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, t + 0.18);
      src.connect(bp).connect(g).connect(masterGain);
      scheduler.trackSource(src);
      src.start(t);
      src.stop(t + 0.22);
      const tone = ctx.createOscillator();
      const tg = ctx.createGain();
      tone.type = 'triangle';
      tone.frequency.value = 220;
      tg.gain.setValueAtTime(0.0001, t);
      tg.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.14 * vel, t + 0.003);
      tg.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, t + 0.1);
      tone.connect(tg).connect(masterGain);
      scheduler.trackSource(tone);
      tone.start(t);
      tone.stop(t + 0.13);
    }
    function playKick(t: number, vel = 1) {
      if (!ctx || !scheduler || !masterGain) return;
      const osc = ctx.createOscillator();
      const g = ctx.createGain();
      osc.type = 'sine';
      osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(70, t);
      osc.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(30, t + 0.18);
      g.gain.setValueAtTime(0.0001, t);
      g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.55 * vel, t + 0.006);
      g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, t + 0.42);
      osc.connect(g).connect(masterGain);
      scheduler.trackSource(osc);
      osc.start(t);
      osc.stop(t + 0.46);
    }
    function playBell(t: number, vel = 1) {
      if (!ctx || !scheduler || !masterGain) return;
      const partials = [
        { freq: 600, gain: 0.22, decay: 4.2 },
        { freq: 1200, gain: 0.16, decay: 3.2 },
        { freq: 1800, gain: 0.08, decay: 1.8 },
      ];
      for (const p of partials) {
        const osc = ctx.createOscillator();
        const g = ctx.createGain();
        osc.type = 'sine';
        osc.frequency.value = p.freq;
        g.gain.setValueAtTime(0.0001, t);
        g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(p.gain * vel, t + 0.008);
        g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, t + p.decay);
        osc.connect(g).connect(masterGain);
        scheduler.trackSource(osc);
        osc.start(t);
        osc.stop(t + p.decay + 0.1);
      }
    }

    // ---- visual ripples ----
    type Ripple = {
      x: number; y: number;
      bornMs: number;
      life: number;     // ms
      maxR: number;
      hue: number;      // 0..1, mapped to color
      voice: Voice;
    };
    const RIPPLES: Ripple[] = [];

    function addRipple(voice: Voice) {
      const canvas = document.getElementById('dr-canvas') as HTMLCanvasElement;
      const W = canvas.width, H = canvas.height;
      // Distribute drops over the whole floor with slight perspective bias toward foreground (bottom half = closer)
      const x = 40 + Math.random() * (W - 80);
      // Bias y toward the bottom 2/3 (perspective: ground starts about 1/4 down)
      const yBias = Math.pow(Math.random(), 0.7);
      const y = H * (0.18 + yBias * 0.78);
      let maxR = 30, life = 900;
      if (voice === 'snare') { maxR = 60; life = 1200; }
      else if (voice === 'kick') { maxR = 110; life = 1800; }
      else if (voice === 'bell') { maxR = 220; life = 3200; }
      RIPPLES.push({ x, y, bornMs: performance.now(), life, maxR, hue: Math.random(), voice });
    }

    // ---- arc ----
    type Section = {
      name: string;
      sparsity: number;       // probability per slot that at least one voice fires
      weights: Partial<Record<Voice, number>>;
      bellOnEntry?: boolean;
    };
    const SECTIONS: Section[] = [
      { name: 'drizzle',         sparsity: 0.10, weights: { hat: 6, snare: 0.5 } },
      { name: 'gathering',       sparsity: 0.22, weights: { hat: 6, snare: 1.2 } },
      { name: 'steady rain',     sparsity: 0.40, weights: { hat: 6, snare: 2, kick: 0.6 } },
      { name: 'building',        sparsity: 0.58, weights: { hat: 6, snare: 3, kick: 1.2 } },
      { name: 'downpour',        sparsity: 0.76, weights: { hat: 6, snare: 4, kick: 2 } },
      { name: 'thunder',         sparsity: 0.85, weights: { hat: 6, snare: 4, kick: 3 }, bellOnEntry: true },
      { name: 'tapering',        sparsity: 0.62, weights: { hat: 6, snare: 3, kick: 1.5 } },
      { name: 'slowing',         sparsity: 0.42, weights: { hat: 6, snare: 2, kick: 0.7 } },
      { name: 'light rain',      sparsity: 0.22, weights: { hat: 6, snare: 1.2 } },
      { name: 'drizzle again',   sparsity: 0.08, weights: { hat: 6, snare: 0.4 } },
    ];

    const SECTION_LEN_SEC = 60;
    const BPM = 96;  // faster than /drum-garden because rain is busier
    const BEAT_SEC = 60 / BPM;
    const SUBDIVISION = 4;  // 16th-note grid
    const SLOT_SEC = BEAT_SEC / SUBDIVISION;
    const TOTAL_SEC = SECTIONS.length * SECTION_LEN_SEC;

    let playing = false;
    let startCtxTime = 0;
    let nextSlotTime = 0;
    let slotIdx = 0;
    let scheduleTimer: number | null = null;
    let uiTimer: number | null = null;
    let lastBellSection = -1;
    let schedulingComplete = false;
    let rafId: number | null = null;

    function pickWeighted(weights: Partial<Record<Voice, number>>): Voice | null {
      const entries = Object.entries(weights) as [Voice, number][];
      let total = 0;
      for (const [, w] of entries) total += w;
      if (total <= 0) return null;
      let r = Math.random() * total;
      for (const [v, w] of entries) { r -= w; if (r <= 0) return v; }
      return entries[0][0];
    }

    function scheduleAhead() {
      if (!playing || !ctx) return;
      const horizon = ctx.currentTime + 0.5;
      while (nextSlotTime < horizon) {
        const elapsed = nextSlotTime - startCtxTime;
        if (elapsed >= TOTAL_SEC) { schedulingComplete = true; break; }
        const sectionIdx = Math.min(SECTIONS.length - 1, Math.floor(Math.max(0, elapsed) / SECTION_LEN_SEC));
        const section = SECTIONS[sectionIdx];

        // Thunder bell on entry
        if (section.bellOnEntry && sectionIdx !== lastBellSection) {
          const sectionStartSec = sectionIdx * SECTION_LEN_SEC;
          if (Math.abs(elapsed - sectionStartSec) < SLOT_SEC * 0.6) {
            playBell(nextSlotTime, 0.85);
            // also visual ripple
            const c = document.getElementById('dr-canvas') as HTMLCanvasElement;
            RIPPLES.push({
              x: c.width / 2 + (Math.random() - 0.5) * c.width * 0.4,
              y: c.height * 0.55,
              bornMs: performance.now(),
              life: 3200, maxR: 280, hue: 0, voice: 'bell',
            });
            lastBellSection = sectionIdx;
          }
        }

        if (Math.random() < section.sparsity) {
          const voice = pickWeighted(section.weights);
          if (voice) {
            const vel = 0.6 + Math.random() * 0.5;
            const t = nextSlotTime;
            switch (voice) {
              case 'hat':   playHat(t, vel); break;
              case 'snare': playSnare(t, vel); break;
              case 'kick':  playKick(t, vel); break;
              case 'bell':  playBell(t, vel); break;
            }
            addRipple(voice);
          }
        }

        nextSlotTime += SLOT_SEC;
        slotIdx++;
      }
      if (playing) scheduleTimer = window.setTimeout(scheduleAhead, 80);
    }

    function drawCanvas() {
      const canvas = document.getElementById('dr-canvas') as HTMLCanvasElement;
      const c2 = canvas.getContext('2d')!;
      const W = canvas.width, H = canvas.height;

      // Background — wet stone tiles seen top-down with subtle perspective gradient
      const grad = c2.createLinearGradient(0, 0, 0, H);
      grad.addColorStop(0, '#2a3d3a');     // far edge
      grad.addColorStop(0.5, '#1f3030');
      grad.addColorStop(1, '#162424');     // near edge
      c2.fillStyle = grad;
      c2.fillRect(0, 0, W, H);

      // Tile pattern — grid of dark wet-looking rectangles
      const tileW = 90, tileH = 60;
      c2.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.04)';
      c2.lineWidth = 1;
      for (let y = 0; y < H; y += tileH) {
        for (let x = (Math.floor(y / tileH) % 2 === 0 ? 0 : tileW / 2); x < W; x += tileW) {
          c2.strokeRect(x, y, tileW, tileH);
        }
      }
      // Subtle wet sheen — top half lighter
      const sheen = c2.createLinearGradient(0, 0, 0, H / 2);
      sheen.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(255,255,255,0.05)');
      sheen.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(255,255,255,0)');
      c2.fillStyle = sheen;
      c2.fillRect(0, 0, W, H / 2);

      // Ripples
      const now = performance.now();
      for (let i = RIPPLES.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
        const r = RIPPLES[i];
        const t = (now - r.bornMs) / r.life;
        if (t >= 1) { RIPPLES.splice(i, 1); continue; }
        const radius = r.maxR * t;
        const alpha = (1 - t) * (1 - t);
        // Color by voice
        let color: string;
        switch (r.voice) {
          case 'hat':   color = `rgba(200,220,230,${alpha * 0.7})`; break;
          case 'snare': color = `rgba(220,200,160,${alpha * 0.75})`; break;
          case 'kick':  color = `rgba(246,193,94,${alpha * 0.7})`; break;
          case 'bell':  color = `rgba(255,255,255,${alpha * 0.85})`; break;
        }
        c2.strokeStyle = color;
        c2.lineWidth = r.voice === 'bell' ? 2.5 : (r.voice === 'kick' ? 2 : 1.3);
        c2.beginPath();
        c2.arc(r.x, r.y, radius, 0, Math.PI * 2);
        c2.stroke();
        // inner secondary ring for bigger drops
        if (r.voice === 'kick' || r.voice === 'bell') {
          c2.strokeStyle = `rgba(255,255,255,${alpha * 0.3})`;
          c2.lineWidth = 0.8;
          c2.beginPath();
          c2.arc(r.x, r.y, radius * 0.6, 0, Math.PI * 2);
          c2.stroke();
        }
        // center pinprick at birth
        if (t < 0.06) {
          c2.fillStyle = color;
          c2.beginPath();
          c2.arc(r.x, r.y, 2.5 * (1 - t * 16), 0, Math.PI * 2);
          c2.fill();
        }
      }
      if (playing) rafId = requestAnimationFrame(drawCanvas);
      else drawIdleCanvas();
    }

    function drawIdleCanvas() {
      // Static canvas when not playing — just the tile floor, no ripples
      const canvas = document.getElementById('dr-canvas') as HTMLCanvasElement;
      const c2 = canvas.getContext('2d')!;
      const W = canvas.width, H = canvas.height;
      const grad = c2.createLinearGradient(0, 0, 0, H);
      grad.addColorStop(0, '#2a3d3a');
      grad.addColorStop(0.5, '#1f3030');
      grad.addColorStop(1, '#162424');
      c2.fillStyle = grad;
      c2.fillRect(0, 0, W, H);
      c2.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.04)';
      c2.lineWidth = 1;
      const tileW = 90, tileH = 60;
      for (let y = 0; y < H; y += tileH) {
        for (let x = (Math.floor(y / tileH) % 2 === 0 ? 0 : tileW / 2); x < W; x += tileW) {
          c2.strokeRect(x, y, tileW, tileH);
        }
      }
      const sheen = c2.createLinearGradient(0, 0, 0, H / 2);
      sheen.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(255,255,255,0.05)');
      sheen.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(255,255,255,0)');
      c2.fillStyle = sheen;
      c2.fillRect(0, 0, W, H / 2);
    }

    function tickUi() {
      if (!ctx) return;
      const elapsed = playing ? ctx.currentTime - startCtxTime : 0;
      const clamped = Math.min(TOTAL_SEC, elapsed);
      const mm = Math.floor(clamped / 60);
      const ss = Math.floor(clamped % 60);
      document.getElementById('dr-status-time')!.textContent =
        `${String(mm).padStart(2, '0')}:${String(ss).padStart(2, '0')}`;
      const si = Math.min(SECTIONS.length - 1, Math.floor(clamped / SECTION_LEN_SEC));
      document.getElementById('dr-status-section')!.textContent = SECTIONS[si].name;
      if (playing && clamped >= TOTAL_SEC && schedulingComplete) {
        stopPlaying(true);
      }
      if (playing) uiTimer = window.setTimeout(tickUi, 250);
    }

    function startPlaying() {
      ensureCtx();
      if (!ctx) return;
      if (ctx.state === 'suspended') ctx.resume();
      playing = true;
      schedulingComplete = false;
      slotIdx = 0;
      lastBellSection = -1;
      RIPPLES.length = 0;
      startCtxTime = ctx.currentTime + 0.25;
      nextSlotTime = startCtxTime;
      document.getElementById('dr-stage')!.setAttribute('data-state', 'playing');
      document.getElementById('dr-status')!.removeAttribute('hidden');
      scheduleAhead();
      tickUi();
      drawCanvas();
    }
    function stopPlaying(natural = false) {
      playing = false;
      if (scheduleTimer != null) { clearTimeout(scheduleTimer); scheduleTimer = null; }
      if (uiTimer != null) { clearTimeout(uiTimer); uiTimer = null; }
      if (rafId != null) { cancelAnimationFrame(rafId); rafId = null; }
      if (!natural && scheduler) scheduler.stopAll();
      document.getElementById('dr-stage')!.setAttribute('data-state', natural ? 'ended' : 'idle');
      document.getElementById('dr-play-label')!.textContent = natural ? 'Again' : 'Begin';
      drawIdleCanvas();
    }

    function init() {
      drawIdleCanvas();
      document.getElementById('dr-play')!.addEventListener('click', () => startPlaying());
      document.getElementById('dr-end')!.addEventListener('click', () => stopPlaying(false));
      document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', () => {
        if (!ctx) return;
        if (document.hidden && playing) ctx.suspend().catch(() => {});
        else if (!document.hidden && playing) ctx.resume().catch(() => {});
      });
    }

    if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
      document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', init);
    } else {
      init();
    }
  </script>
</BlockLayout>
